    {
      "id": "jiangnan-shu-roads",
      "title": "Jiangnan & the Shu Roads",
      "titleZh": "江南与蜀道",
      "subtitle": "Canals, yellow mountains, river cities and the old road into Sichuan.",
      "subtitleZh": "水巷、黄山、江城的雾，与通往四川的旧路。",
      "note": "A slow month of water towns, cloud seas, teahouses and night trains. Fast rail where it helps; long afternoons where it does not.",
      "noteZh": "用一个慢月，走水乡、云海、茶馆与夜车。能坐高铁的地方坐高铁，该慢下来的地方就慢下来。",
      "color": "terracotta",
      "stops": [
        {
          "id": "shanghai",
          "name": "Shanghai",
          "nameZh": "上海",
          "region": "Shanghai",
          "regionZh": "上海",
          "country": "China",
          "countryZh": "中国",
          "lat": 31.2304,
          "lon": 121.4737,
          "arrive": "2027-04-03",
          "depart": "2027-04-05",
          "note": "Long breakfasts in the French Concession, then the Bund at dusk. Start slowly; the trip has a lot of moving parts ahead.",
          "noteZh": "在法租界吃一顿漫长的早饭，傍晚沿外滩散步。先慢一点，后面的路还很长。",
          "links": [
            {
              "label": "Shanghai tourism",
              "labelZh": "上海旅游",
