          "lon": 120.5853,
          "arrive": "2027-04-05",
          "depart": "2027-04-07",
          "note": "Gardens in the morning, canals in the afternoon, and a day lost in the Pingjiang Road lanes.",
          "noteZh": "上午看园林，下午坐船，剩下的时间在平江路的小巷里迷路。",
