          "countryZh": "中国",
          "lat": 30.2741,
          "lon": 120.1551,
          "arrive": "2027-04-07",
          "depart": "2027-04-10",
          "note": "West Lake before the crowds. In the afternoon, take the bus into the Longjing tea hills and walk back down through the villages.",
          "noteZh": "趁人少去看西湖。下午坐车去龙井的茶山，再从村子里慢慢走下来。",
