          "arrive": "2027-04-14",
          "depart": "2027-04-17",
          "note": "A city of stairs, monorails and night crossings. Eat hotpot once, then find the small noodle shops on the back streets.",
          "noteZh": "阶梯、轻轨，还有夜晚过江的轮渡。吃一次火锅，再去背街找小面馆。",
